$PRODUCES clearcmds.c

$BUILTIN list
$FUNCTION list_builtin
$SHORT_DOC list [arg ...]
Clearer name for `ls'.

Runs the real `ls' command with the given arguments.  bbash additive
builtin; `ls' itself is completely unchanged and still works normally.

Exit Status:
Returns the exit status of `ls'.
$END

$BUILTIN copy
$FUNCTION copy_builtin
$SHORT_DOC copy [arg ...]
Clearer name for `cp'.

Runs the real `cp' command with the given arguments.  bbash additive
builtin; `cp' itself is completely unchanged and still works normally.

Exit Status:
Returns the exit status of `cp'.
$END

