Exit Status:
Returns the exit status of `mv'.
$END

$BUILTIN delete
$FUNCTION delete_builtin
$SHORT_DOC delete [arg ...]
Clearer name for `rm'.

Runs the real `rm' command with the given arguments.  bbash additive
