$BUILTIN make-dir
$DOCNAME make_dir
$FUNCTION make_dir_builtin
$SHORT_DOC make-dir [arg ...]
Clearer name for `mkdir'.

Runs the real `mkdir' command with the given arguments.  bbash additive
